<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>每日新闻摘要</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/</link><language>zh-CN</language><description>中文新闻与背景解读</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>马斯克称对中期选举巨额投入“相当愚蠢”，否认自己是MAGA</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/#70420f46-3746-52d1-9da3-89dd7584acb9</link><description>&lt;h3&gt;事件&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;马斯克表示对自己在中期选举中的创纪录支出感到“相当愚蠢”，并称自己“不是MAGA”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm9q8j2z3gg8o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/18/elon-musk-maga-trump"&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://variety.com/2026/digital/news/elon-musk-pretty-foolish-midterm-election-races-not-maga-1236952400/"&gt;Variety&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;背景&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;马斯克是此次选举最大的个人捐款者，向支持特朗普所在政党的方向投入约4.46亿美元；共和党在选举中遭遇大败。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm9q8j2z3gg8o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://variety.com/2026/digital/news/elon-musk-pretty-foolish-midterm-election-races-not-maga-1236952400/"&gt;Variety&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>国际政治</category><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">70420f46-3746-52d1-9da3-89dd7584acb9</guid></item><item><title>泰勒·斯威夫特时隔13年重返CMA颁奖礼，串烧《Our Song》与新单曲</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/#5bb868e1-c208-542b-a6c8-8672194d11e4</link><description>&lt;h3&gt;事件&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;泰勒·斯威夫特在第60届CMA颁奖礼上表演《I Knew It, I Knew You》与《Our Song》串烧，这是她13年来首次在该颁奖礼演出。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://www.thewrap.com/creative-content/music/taylor-swift-cma-awards-performance-i-knew-it-i-knew-you-our-song/"&gt;TheWrap&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/music/music-news/taylor-swift-2026-cma-awards-performance-our-song-1236758939/"&gt;The Hollywood Reporter&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://variety.com/2026/music/news/taylor-swift-performs-i-knew-it-i-knew-you-our-song-cmas-1236952619/"&gt;Variety&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;背景&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;《I Knew It, I Knew You》是《玩具总动员5》原声歌曲，获年度单曲提名。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://www.thewrap.com/creative-content/music/taylor-swift-cma-awards-performance-i-knew-it-i-knew-you-our-song/"&gt;TheWrap&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/music/music-news/taylor-swift-2026-cma-awards-performance-our-song-1236758939/"&gt;The Hollywood Reporter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>全球娱乐</category><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5bb868e1-c208-542b-a6c8-8672194d11e4</guid></item><item><title>克里斯·帕拉特将主演派拉蒙科幻片《The Traveler》并签三年优先合作协议</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/#5f2f1505-3650-581d-ae9a-9e1bb0b04d4f</link><description>&lt;h3&gt;事件&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;克里斯·帕拉特将主演派拉蒙改编自约瑟夫·埃克特小说的科幻片《The Traveler》，并通过其公司签署三年优先制作协议。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://www.thewrap.com/creative-content/movies/chris-pratt-to-star-the-traveler-adaptation-paramount/"&gt;TheWrap&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/chris-pratt-to-star-in-sci-fi-movie-the-traveler-1236758984/"&gt;The Hollywood Reporter&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://variety.com/2026/film/news/chris-pratt-the-traveler-paramount-deal-1236952517/"&gt;Variety&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;背景&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;影片讲述一名不情愿的时间旅行者与其子之间的故事。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://variety.com/2026/film/news/chris-pratt-the-traveler-paramount-deal-1236952517/"&gt;Variety&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>全球娱乐</category><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5f2f1505-3650-581d-ae9a-9e1bb0b04d4f</guid></item><item><title>Instagram新增发布后编辑快拍功能，限15分钟</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/#d9dc0dc5-4b8d-5832-923e-09b42a29d297</link><description>&lt;h3&gt;事件&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram推出发布后编辑快拍功能，用户可在发布后15分钟内修改文字、音乐或配文，无需删除重发。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/18/instagram-finally-lets-users-edit-stories-after-publishing-but-theres-a-catch/"&gt;9to5Mac&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.engadget.com/2320953/you-can-finally-edit-an-instagram-story-without-deleting-it/"&gt;Engadget&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/1036941/instagram-now-lets-you-edit-your-stories-after-you-post-them"&gt;The Verge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>消费电子</category><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d9dc0dc5-4b8d-5832-923e-09b42a29d297</guid></item><item><title>苹果公布2026年App Store Awards入围名单，45款应用与游戏入选</title><link>https://der035.github.io/news-digest-public/#38ed88f6-37a6-5167-b786-7e68bf5ea6e9</link><description>&lt;h3&gt;事件&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;苹果公布2026年App Store Awards入围名单，由全球编辑选出45款应用和游戏，涵盖12个类别。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://sspai.com/post/119239"&gt;少数派&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/meet-the-2026-app-store-award-finalists/"&gt;Apple Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;背景&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;入围涵盖iPhone、iPad、Mac、Vision Pro、Apple Watch、Apple TV、Apple Arcade及文化影响类别，最终获奖名单将在未来几周公布。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="sources"&gt;来源 &lt;a href="https://sspai.com/post/119239"&gt;少数派&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/meet-the-2026-app-store-award-finalists/"&gt;Apple Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>消费电子</category><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">38ed88f6-37a6-5167-b786-7e68bf5ea6e9</guid></item></channel></rss>